{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39165","headline":"中渡晚眺 · 韦庄","name":"中渡晚眺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"魏王堤畔草如烟，有客伤时独扣舷。\n妖气欲昏唐社稷，夕阳空照汉山川。\n千重碧树笼春苑，万缕红霞衬碧天。\n家寄杜陵归不得，一回回首一潸然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}